 Primitive data types
--------------------
primitive data types have the single value 
ex:strings , number,true or false, null ,undefined
 
 we can use the values in the string by using $ symbol
 `${variablename}`

 undefined
 ------
 if we don't assign any value it will in undefined mode
 by default.
 But only for defined and not assigned

 Non primitive data types
 ----------------------
 it contain multiple values ex=arrays,objects,functions
array-->can contain the values which can acceced by index values
let a=[1,2,2,];
object-->has the key and values can be access the value by using the key
let NameAge={divya:10,Sarala:20};
functions-->we can encolse the statements to make into a singular group

 
